WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.255
Hi, I'm Paul who is a Clippy.

00:00:02.455 --> 00:00:08.280
Welcome to wtfOS. This desktop is your game world. I'll be around to help.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.130
The icons on your desktop open programs.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.130
Click one to get started.

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:16.822
Looking for something else?

00:00:17.022 --> 00:00:20.572
Open Stuffs on the taskbar to find the rest of your apps.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.780
You can move or minimize windows.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.105
Find them again on the taskbar whenever you're ready.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:31.538
Mission Control shows challenges, progress, and rewards.

00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:34.488
Some missions can earn XP or rewards.

00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:38.638
Try Arcade for games, or Create for making things.

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:41.513
Events and Talk are here when you want people.

00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:45.322
You don't need to learn it all now. Pick one thing.

00:00:45.522 --> 00:00:48.397
I'll be haunting your desktop, in a helpful way.
